mod.desc:
Stormworks Railway Overhaul (SRO) v1.1.2. is a mod that:
- Replaces the original railways on the entire map with 3D rails; 
- Adds more points in the path between vanilla ones, which ensures a smoother train ride on the rails; 
- adds two types of way signs - a kilometer sign (on Sawyer the starting point is North Harbor, on Meier - FJ Warner Docks), and a picket sign; 
- changed the color of the ballast (gravel embankment under the rails); 
- Trains are now located 28 cm above the ground surface relative to the original game, and now trains will beat their bellies against the ground less.
- Rails and sleepers have a collision! Consider this.
